{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のタイトルはお騒がせしました(゜Д゜)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月のタイトルは長いってめっちゃ言われますが、皆さん読んでます!?(笑)正直なところ受け流してますぅ!?(笑)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで負けずに前回の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解はつつむと読むこの漢字"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『裹』めっちゃマイナーな漢字なので普段あまり見かけないですよね!というかどのタイミングで使うのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼制服を着た眼鏡(´・ω・)どーん／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/01/7344680/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インテリ系(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑若月の場合は必然的に(笑)がついてきます。デフォです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど勉強する時や何か見るときはかけます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桃屋的なあれか。と言ったそこの貴方!!屋上で待つ!!←ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてアホ丸出しなことを言っていたらまさかの電車を乗り過ごした。病んだ、けど生きよう。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダッシュで出ようとしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻スレスレでドアがドアが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...お閉まりになられた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしいのでいかにも次の駅で降りるために席を立ったように振る舞ったよ。うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪〜(￣ε￣){別に、つ、次だし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","tex